## 🛑 1. UC-PAR-07 — Ngừng bán voucher

### A. Lifelines (Đối tượng tham gia)
- **[Actor]** `Partner` / `Admin`
- **[Presentation]** `VoucherDetailPage`, `saveVoucherApi`, `VoucherController`
- **[Business]** `VoucherService`, `AuditLogService`
- **[Data/External]** `VoucherRepository`, `AuditLogRepository`, `Supabase DB`

### B. Detailed Interaction Flow
1. **[1] Actor ➔ [Presentation] VoucherDetailPage**: `clickStopSelling(voucherId)`
   - *Mô tả*: Người dùng nhấn nút "Ngừng bán" khi voucher đang ở trạng thái `Dang ban` hoặc `Tam ngung`.
2. **[2] [Presentation] VoucherDetailPage ➔ [Presentation] saveVoucherApi**: `saveVoucherApi({ ma_voucher, trang_thai: "Ngung ban", trang_thai_kiem_duyet: "Da duyet" })`
   - *Tầng*: [Presentation ➔ Presentation]
3. **[3] [Presentation] saveVoucherApi ➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `PUT /api/vouchers/:id`
   - *Kiểu gọi*: Asynchronous (HTTP Request)
4. **[4] [Presentation/API] VoucherController ➔ [Business] VoucherService**: `updateVoucher(id, payload, actorId)`
   - *Tầng*: [Presentation ➔ Business]
5. **[5] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `findById(id)`
   - *Tầng*: [Business ➔ Data] (Lấy thông tin `existing` để làm `before` cho Audit log)
6. **[6] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `update(id, { trang_thai: "Ngung ban" })`
   - *Tầng*: [Business ➔ Data]
7. **[7] [Data] VoucherRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `UPDATE voucher SET trang_thai = 'Ngung ban' WHERE ma_voucher = id`
8. **[8] [External] Supabase DB --➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `return updatedRow`
9. **[9] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ action: "UPDATE_VOUCHER", before: { trang_thai: existing.trang_thai }, after: { trang_thai: "Ngung ban" }, reason: "Cập nhật thông tin chi tiết chương trình Voucher" })`
10. **[10] [Business] AuditLogService ➔ [Data] AuditLogRepository**: `create(logEntry)`
11. **[11] [Data] AuditLogRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `INSERT INTO log_ht`
12. **[12] [Business] VoucherService --➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `return updatedVoucher`
13. **[13] [Presentation/API] VoucherController --➔ [Presentation] VoucherDetailPage**: `res.json({ success: true, data })`

