## 📝 5. UC-PAR-11 — Cập nhật voucher

### A. Lifelines (Đối tượng tham gia)
- **[Actor]** `Partner`
- **[Presentation]** `VoucherFormPage`, `saveVoucherApi`, `VoucherController`
- **[Business]** `VoucherService`, `uploadBase64ToSupabase`, `AuditLogService`
- **[Data/External]** `VoucherRepository`, `VoucherBranchRepository`, `AuditLogRepository`, `Supabase Storage`, `Supabase DB`

### B. Detailed Interaction Flow
1. **[1] Partner ➔ [Presentation] VoucherFormPage**: `handleSave(mode)`
   - *Mô tả*: Chỉnh sửa các trường và chọn "Lưu thay đổi" (`mode='update'`) hoặc "✓ Lưu & Gửi duyệt ngay" (`mode='submit'`).
2. **[2] [Presentation] VoucherFormPage ➔ [Presentation] saveVoucherApi**: `saveVoucherApi(formData)`
3. **[3] [Presentation] saveVoucherApi ➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `PUT /api/vouchers/:id`
4. **[4] [Presentation/API] VoucherController ➔ [Business] VoucherService**: `updateVoucher(id, payload, actorId)`
5. **ALT [if payload.hinh_anh_url starts with "data:"]**:
   - **[Business] VoucherService ➔ [Business] uploadBase64ToSupabase**: `uploadBase64ToSupabase(payload.hinh_anh_url, "vouchers")`
   - **[Business] uploadBase64ToSupabase ➔ [External] Supabase Storage**: `upload(fileName, buffer)`
   - **[External] Supabase Storage --➔ [Business] VoucherService**: `return publicUrl`
6. **[6] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `findById(id)`
   - *Mô tả*: Lấy dữ liệu hiện tại trước khi update để lưu snapshot vào `before` log.
7. **[7] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `update(id, payload)`
8. **[8] [Data] VoucherRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `UPDATE voucher SET ... WHERE ma_voucher = id`
9. **OPT [if payload.ma_chi_nhanh is Array]**:
   - **[Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherBranchRepository**: `setBranchesForVoucher(id, payload.ma_chi_nhanh)`
   - **[Data] VoucherBranchRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `DELETE + INSERT INTO voucher_cn`
10. **[10] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ action: isSubmitReview ? "SUBMIT_VOUCHER_REVIEW" : "UPDATE_VOUCHER", before: existing, after: updated })`
11. **[11] [Business] AuditLogService ➔ [Data] AuditLogRepository**: `create(logEntry)`
12. **[12] [Data] AuditLogRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `INSERT INTO log_ht`
13. **[13] [Business] VoucherService --➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `return updatedVoucher`
14. **[14] [Presentation/API] VoucherController --➔ [Presentation] VoucherFormPage**: `res.json({ success: true, data: result })`

