## 🛡️ 7. UC-ADM-02 — Admin quản lý và duyệt đối tác

### A. Lifelines (Đối tượng tham gia)
- **[Actor]** `Admin`
- **[Presentation]** `PartnerDetailPage` / `PartnerManagementPage`, `PartnerController`
- **[Business]** `PartnerService`, `AuditLogService`
- **[Data/External]** `PartnerRepository`, `BranchRepository`, `AuditLogRepository`, `Supabase DB`

### B. Detailed Interaction Flow

#### Phân luồng A: Admin Phê duyệt Đối tác
1. **[1] Admin ➔ [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage**: `clickApprovePartner(partnerId, reason)`
2. **[2] [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage ➔ [Presentation/API] PartnerController**: `POST /api/partners/:id/approve`
3. **[3] [Presentation/API] PartnerController ➔ [Business] PartnerService**: `approvePartner(id, reason, actorId)`
4. **[4] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Data] PartnerRepository**: `updateStatus(id, "Dang hoat dong")`
5. **[5] [Data] PartnerRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `UPDATE hosodn SET trang_thai = 'Dang hoat dong' WHERE ma_hs = id`
6. **[6] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Data] BranchRepository**: `findByPartnerId(id)`
7. **[7] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Data] BranchRepository**: `update(branchId, { trang_thai: "Dang hoat dong" })` (cho tất cả chi nhánh thuộc đối tác)
8. **[8] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ actorId, actorRole: "ADMIN", action: "APPROVE_PARTNER", targetType: "HOSODN", targetId: id, before: { trang_thai: "Cho duyet" }, after: { trang_thai: "Dang hoat dong" } }, strict = true)`
9. **[9] [Business] AuditLogService ➔ [Data] AuditLogRepository**: `create(logEntry)`
10. **[10] [Data] AuditLogRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `INSERT INTO log_ht`
11. **[11] [Business] PartnerService --➔ [Presentation/API] PartnerController**: `return updatedPartner`
12. **[12] [Presentation/API] PartnerController --➔ [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage**: `res.json({ success: true, data })`

#### Phân luồng B: Admin Từ chối Đối tác
13. **[13] Admin ➔ [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage**: `clickRejectPartner(partnerId, reason)`
14. **[14] [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage ➔ [Presentation/API] PartnerController**: `POST /api/partners/:id/reject`
15. **[15] [Presentation/API] PartnerController ➔ [Business] PartnerService**: `rejectPartner(id, reason, actorId)`
16. **[16] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Data] PartnerRepository**: `updateStatus(id, "Tu choi", reason)`
17. **[17] [Data] PartnerRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `UPDATE hosodn SET trang_thai = 'Tu choi', ly_do_tu_choi = reason WHERE ma_hs = id`
18. **[18] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ actorId, actorRole: "ADMIN", action: "REJECT_PARTNER", targetType: "HOSODN", targetId: id, after: { trang_thai: "Tu choi", ly_do_tu_choi: reason } }, strict = true)`
19. **[19] [Business] AuditLogService ➔ [Data] AuditLogRepository**: `create(logEntry)`
20. **[20] [Presentation/API] PartnerController --➔ [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage**: `res.json({ success: true, data })`

#### Phân luồng C: Admin Tạm khóa / Mở khóa Đối tác
21. **[21] Admin ➔ [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage**: `clickLockOrUnlockPartner(partnerId, isLocking, reason)`
22. **[22] [Presentation] PartnerDetailPage ➔ [Presentation/API] PartnerController**: `POST /api/partners/:id/lock`
23. **[23] [Presentation/API] PartnerController ➔ [Business] PartnerService**: `lockUnlockPartner(id, isLocking, reason, actorId)`
24. **[24] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Data] PartnerRepository**: `updateStatus(id, isLocking ? "Tam khoa" : "Dang hoat dong", reason)`
25. **[25] [Business] PartnerService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ action: isLocking ? "LOCK_PARTNER" : "UNLOCK_PARTNER", actorRole: "ADMIN" })`

