## ⚖️ 8. UC-ADM-03 — Admin duyệt voucher

### A. Lifelines (Đối tượng tham gia)
- **[Actor]** `Admin`
- **[Presentation]** `VoucherApprovalDetailPage`, `VoucherController`
- **[Business]** `VoucherService`, `AuditLogService`
- **[Data/External]** `VoucherRepository`, `AuditLogRepository`, `Supabase DB`

### B. Detailed Interaction Flow

#### Phân luồng A: Admin Phê duyệt Voucher
1. **[1] Admin ➔ [Presentation] VoucherApprovalDetailPage**: `clickApproveVoucher(voucherId, isHidden, reason)`
   - *Mô tả*: Admin bấm "Phê duyệt công bố" (`isHidden = false`) hoặc "Phê duyệt (Tạm ẩn)" (`isHidden = true`).
2. **[2] [Presentation] VoucherApprovalDetailPage ➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `POST /api/vouchers/:id/approve`
3. **[3] [Presentation/API] VoucherController ➔ [Business] VoucherService**: `approveVoucher(id, isHidden, reason, actorId)`
4. **[4] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `updateStatus(id, status, "Da duyet")`
   - *Mô tả*: `status = isHidden ? "Tam ngung" : "Dang ban"`.
5. **[5] [Data] VoucherRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `UPDATE voucher SET trang_thai = status, trang_thai_kiem_duyet = 'Da duyet' WHERE ma_voucher = id`
6. **[6] [External] Supabase DB --➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `return updatedRow`
7. **[7] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ actorId, actorRole: "ADMIN", action: "APPROVE_VOUCHER", targetType: "VOUCHER", targetId: id, before: { trang_thai: "Cho duyet" }, after: { trang_thai: status, trang_thai_kiem_duyet: "Da duyet" }, reason: ... }, strict = true)`
8. **[8] [Business] AuditLogService ➔ [Data] AuditLogRepository**: `create(logEntry)`
9. **[9] [Data] AuditLogRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `INSERT INTO log_ht`
10. **[10] [Business] VoucherService --➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `return res`
11. **[11] [Presentation/API] VoucherController --➔ [Presentation] VoucherApprovalDetailPage**: `res.json({ success: true, data: res })`

#### Phân luồng B: Admin Từ chối Voucher
12. **[12] Admin ➔ [Presentation] VoucherApprovalDetailPage**: `clickRejectVoucher(voucherId, reason)`
13. **[13] [Presentation] VoucherApprovalDetailPage ➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `POST /api/vouchers/:id/reject`
14. **[14] [Presentation/API] VoucherController ➔ [Business] VoucherService**: `rejectVoucher(id, reason, actorId)`
15. **[15] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Data] VoucherRepository**: `updateStatus(id, "Tu choi", "Tu choi", reason)`
16. **[16] [Data] VoucherRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `UPDATE voucher SET trang_thai = 'Tu choi', trang_thai_kiem_duyet = 'Tu choi', ly_do_tu_choi = reason WHERE ma_voucher = id`
17. **[17] [Business] VoucherService ➔ [Business] AuditLogService**: `log({ actorId, actorRole: "ADMIN", action: "REJECT_VOUCHER", targetType: "VOUCHER", targetId: id, before: { trang_thai: "Cho duyet" }, after: { trang_thai: "Tu choi", ly_do_tu_choi: reason }, reason: reason }, strict = true)`
18. **[18] [Business] AuditLogService ➔ [Data] AuditLogRepository**: `create(logEntry)`
19. **[19] [Data] AuditLogRepository ➔ [External] Supabase DB**: `INSERT INTO log_ht`
20. **[20] [Business] VoucherService --➔ [Presentation/API] VoucherController**: `return res`
21. **[21] [Presentation/API] VoucherController --➔ [Presentation] VoucherApprovalDetailPage**: `res.json({ success: true, data: res })`